    SAIKI EMOTES V2 - CLEAN BOOT BUILD
    English only.

    IMPORTANT:
    This version is intentionally rebuilt from scratch.
    It does NOT load the old 7,000+ line system.

    Included:
      - Saiki-style pastel GUI
      - Emote player
      - Speed controller
      - Search
      - Next / Previous pages
      - Roblox Marketplace emote search
      - HTTP fallback
      - Safe GUI parenting for common executors
      - Built-in fallback emotes so the GUI still opens if catalog search fails
      - No splash screen, no external loadstring, no Firebase, no Vexro reload

    The GUI is created BEFORE any Marketplace/API request.
    Therefore a catalog/API problem cannot prevent the GUI from appearing.
]]

